  "payload": {
    "rawResponseText": "Owners seeking **brand affiliation without sacrificing the property’s identity** typically consider **soft brands or collection brands**. The most common shortlist in the Caribbean and Latin America includes:\n\n### Major global-chain collections\n\n- **Marriott:** Autograph Collection, Tribute Portfolio, and—for luxury properties—The Luxury Collection. These allow hotels to retain their own name, concept, and design while accessing Marriott Bonvoy and Marriott’s distribution platform. ([hotel-development.marriott.com](https://www.hotel-development.marriott.com/brands/premium-brands?utm_source=openai))\n- **Hilton:** Curio Collection, Tapestry Collection, and luxury-oriented LXR Hotels & Resorts. Curio and Tapestry specifically emphasize retaining each property’s story and local character. ([stories.hilton.com](https://stories.hilton.com/releases/hiltons-curio-and-tapestry-collections-celebrate-200th-hotel-milestones?utm_source=openai))\n- **Hyatt:** The Unbound Collection and Destination by Hyatt; the newer Unscripted by Hyatt targets a more flexible upscale segment. ([hyatt.com](https://www.hyatt.com/development/ourbrands/theunboundcollectionbyhyatt?utm_source=openai))\n- **IHG:** Vignette Collection, principally for luxury and upper-upscale independent hotels seeking light-touch branding and IHG One Rewards distribution. ([ihgplc.com](https://www.ihgplc.com/en/our-brands/vignette?utm_source=openai))\n- **Accor:** MGallery in upper-upscale, Emblems Collection in luxury, and Handwritten Collection for more conversion-friendly upscale or midscale projects. ([group.accor.com](https://group.accor.com/en/news-stories/collection-brands-handwritten-emblems-mgallery?utm_source=openai))\n- **Wyndham:** Registry Collection Hotels for luxury resorts and hotels, and Trademark Collection by Wyndham for upper-midscale and upscale independents. Both explicitly allow owners to preserve their individual identity. ([development.wyndhamhotels.com](https://development.wyndhamhotels.com/brand/registry-collection-hotels/?utm_source=openai))\n\n### Other flexible alternatives\n\n- **BWH Hotels:** WorldHotels, BW Premier Collection, and BW Signature Collection. ([development.bwhhotels.com](https://development.bwhhotels.com/signature?utm_source=openai))\n- **Choice Hotels:** Ascend Hotel Collection, generally positioned as an upscale affiliation offering considerable operational independence. ([choicehotelsdevelopment.com](https://www.choicehotelsdevelopment.com/sfsites/c/cms/delivery/media/MCLE5PDHTZBBC7VBPRBOE3ZUGOGY?utm_source=openai))\n- **Independent luxury affiliations:** Preferred Hotels & Resorts and The Leading Hotels of the World are also frequently evaluated when the owner wants sales, distribution, and loyalty support with even less visible corporate branding.\n\nIn practice, the **most frequent head-to-head comparisons** for an upscale or luxury CALA hotel are usually **Autograph vs. Curio vs. Unbound vs. Vignette vs. MGallery**. The appropriate choice depends on the hotel’s positioning, key feeder markets, loyalty-program contribution, conversion requirements, fees, territorial protection, and whether the agreement is a franchise, management contract, or lighter commercial affiliation.",
